cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "β-Sn Orientation Calculator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tatsumi
    given-names: Hiroaki
    affiliation: The University of Osaka
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Browser-based calculator of the thermoelastic response of a β-Sn grain
  under in-plane constraint. From Bunge Euler angles it gives the position on
  the ND inverse pole figure, the maximum relative resolved shear stress
  coefficient, the active slip system, the stress tensor and the elastic
  strain energy density per kelvin.
keywords:
  - beta-tin
  - solder
  - crystal orientation
  - thermal expansion anisotropy
  - slip system
  - inverse pole figure
references:
  - type: article
    authors:
      - family-names: Xian
        given-names: J. W.
    title: "The role of microstructure in the thermal fatigue of solder joints"
    journal: Nature Communications
    volume: 15
    year: 2024
    doi: 10.1038/s41467-024-48532-6
